    "body": "A [proposal by Nicholas Stimpson](https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=22034) would broaden the definition of `<small>` somewhat so that\r\n\r\n```\r\n<h2>Flowers, Bees, and Honey <small>and other things I don't understand</small></h2>\r\n<p>…</p>\r\n<h2>Bears, Salmon and Eggs</h2>\r\n<p>…</p>\r\n```\r\n\r\ncould be used. Looks good to me! Related: https://github.com/w3c/html/issues/929 ",
